WEBVTT

00:02.258 --> 00:04.427
KATARA: Water.

00:04.844 --> 00:06.304
Earth.

00:06.596 --> 00:08.598
Fire.

00:08.890 --> 00:10.308
Air.

00:11.142 --> 00:15.104
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.438 --> 00:19.275
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.776 --> 00:22.403
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:22.529 --> 00:23.738
could stop them.

00:23.863 --> 00:26.699
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

00:27.367 --> 00:29.494
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I discovered

00:29.577 --> 00:32.664
the new Avatar, an airbender named Aang.

00:32.956 --> 00:35.166
And although
his airbending skills are great,

00:35.291 --> 00:37.585
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

00:37.710 --> 00:38.920
AANG: Oof!

00:39.045 --> 00:42.006
But I believe Aang can save the world.

00:56.426 --> 00:58.970
( COMET ROARING )

01:04.059 --> 01:06.102
APPA: ( BELLOWS )

01:08.063 --> 01:11.232
Zuko, don't worry. We can take Azula.

01:11.316 --> 01:12.567
I'm not worried about her.

01:12.692 --> 01:14.402
I'm worried about Aang.

01:14.486 --> 01:16.613
What if he doesn't have the guts
to take out my father?

01:17.280 --> 01:18.823
What if he loses?

01:18.948 --> 01:20.867
Aang won't lose.

01:20.992 --> 01:22.702
He's gonna come back.

01:23.787 --> 01:25.288
He has to.

01:41.346 --> 01:42.555
( CRUNCHES )

01:42.680 --> 01:44.140
( SPITS )

01:44.265 --> 01:46.476
What am I holding?

01:47.018 --> 01:49.104
A cherry pit, Princess.

01:49.312 --> 01:51.439
Correct. And what day is this?

01:52.232 --> 01:53.900
It is the day of your coronation.

01:54.359 --> 01:55.735
Yes, it is.

01:55.860 --> 01:57.028
So, please, tell me why,

01:57.153 --> 01:59.114
on the most important day of my life,

01:59.239 --> 02:01.783
you decided to leave a pit in my cherry?

02:01.908 --> 02:05.620
It wasn't a decision,
it was just a small mistake.

02:05.745 --> 02:06.955
Small?

02:07.080 --> 02:10.125
Do you realize what could have happened
if I hadn't sensed the pit in time?

02:10.708 --> 02:13.503
I suppose you could have choked?

02:13.628 --> 02:17.590
Yes, then you understand
the severity of your crime.

02:18.258 --> 02:20.844
I understand, Princess.
Please, forgive me.

02:21.469 --> 02:22.804
Oh, very well.

02:22.929 --> 02:26.015
Since it is a special day,
I will show mercy.

02:27.100 --> 02:29.644
You are banished.
Leave this palace immediately.

02:32.730 --> 02:33.815
What are you all looking at?

02:33.940 --> 02:35.567
I have two feet that need scrubbing.

02:36.109 --> 02:38.319
And make sure you get in between the toes.

02:38.444 --> 02:39.863
I won't have my first day as Fire Lord

02:39.988 --> 02:41.990
marred by poor foot hygiene.

02:46.911 --> 02:50.623
It's weird to say, but the
comet actually looks beautiful.

02:50.957 --> 02:53.751
Too bad the Fire Lord's about
to use it to destroy the world.

03:19.694 --> 03:22.989
SOKKA: We're too late!
The fleet's already taking off!

03:23.114 --> 03:24.991
TOPH: Then we're taking off, too.

03:25.116 --> 03:26.534
- Where's the closest airship?
- It's right―

03:26.618 --> 03:27.702
ALL: ( SCREAMING )

03:34.542 --> 03:35.627
( GRUNTS )

04:07.158 --> 04:09.619
You sent for us, Princess?
Is everything all right?

04:09.786 --> 04:12.080
Actually, everything's not all right.

04:12.205 --> 04:14.249
Do you know how long
it took you to get here?

04:14.374 --> 04:16.084
Uh, few minutes, I guess.

04:16.209 --> 04:18.002
AZULA: Five, to be precise...

04:18.127 --> 04:20.004
In which time an assassin
could have snuck in,

04:20.129 --> 04:22.757
done away with me,
and been on his merry way.

04:22.882 --> 04:24.300
My apologies, Princess.

04:24.509 --> 04:26.928
Is this how you plan
to treat your new Fire Lord...

04:27.053 --> 04:28.930
With tardiness and disloyalty?

04:29.055 --> 04:30.723
The Dai Li would never betray you.

04:30.890 --> 04:33.184
And I'm sure that's just
what you told Long Feng

04:33.268 --> 04:35.770
before you turned
against him and joined me.

04:37.230 --> 04:39.399
- You're all banished!
- But―

04:39.524 --> 04:41.067
AZULA: Goodbye!

04:46.489 --> 04:48.449
Please send in
the next group on your way out.

05:00.295 --> 05:02.213
Shh...

05:04.841 --> 05:06.759
( KNOCKS ON DOOR )

05:06.884 --> 05:08.511
( DOOR SLAMS )

05:19.230 --> 05:20.231
Oh!

05:24.152 --> 05:26.279
( GRUNTING )

05:35.455 --> 05:37.415
( GROANS, THUDS )

05:44.005 --> 05:46.632
- That's how it's done.
- SOKKA: Good work, Toph.

05:46.758 --> 05:48.217
Time to take control of the ship.

05:48.343 --> 05:49.469
Take the wheel.

05:49.594 --> 05:50.678
That's a great idea.

05:50.803 --> 05:53.139
Let the blind girl
steer the giant airship.

05:53.264 --> 05:54.849
I was talking to Suki.

05:55.475 --> 05:57.643
That would make a lot more sense.

05:57.769 --> 05:59.520
What are we gonna do
about the rest of the crew?

05:59.812 --> 06:01.314
Take us down closer to the water.

06:01.439 --> 06:02.857
I've got an idea.

06:06.152 --> 06:08.696
( CLEARS THROAT ) Attention, crew,

06:08.821 --> 06:10.490
this is your captain speaking.

06:10.615 --> 06:13.368
Everyone please report to
the bomb bay immediately,

06:13.493 --> 06:16.788
for hot cakes and sweet cream.

06:16.913 --> 06:20.041
We have a very special
birthday to celebrate.

06:26.839 --> 06:29.634
( INDISTINCT CHATTER )

06:29.759 --> 06:31.677
Hey, I'm Qin Lee.

06:31.803 --> 06:33.763
I work up in Communications.

06:33.888 --> 06:35.056
Oh, hi.

06:35.181 --> 06:37.016
I work down in the engine room.

06:37.141 --> 06:39.352
That's probably why
we've never met before.

06:39.435 --> 06:40.520
Big airship, you know?

06:40.645 --> 06:42.980
- Uh-huh.
- Yep...

06:43.106 --> 06:45.400
So, do you know whose birthday it is?

06:45.525 --> 06:48.903
I can't believe the captain
remembered my birthday!

06:49.028 --> 06:50.571
He really does care!

06:50.696 --> 06:53.241
CREW: ( SCREAMING )

06:53.324 --> 06:54.867
( SPLASHING )

06:55.618 --> 06:57.912
( ALL GASPING )

06:59.455 --> 07:01.666
Happy birthday.

07:05.545 --> 07:08.131
Fire Lord Ozai, here we come.

07:27.483 --> 07:29.694
Azula, we heard what happened.

07:29.819 --> 07:31.863
Why have you banished all your servants...

07:32.238 --> 07:34.115
...all your Dai Li agents...

07:34.198 --> 07:35.908
...and the Imperial Firebenders?

07:36.200 --> 07:37.785
None of them could be trusted.

07:37.869 --> 07:40.288
Sooner or later they all
would have betrayed me.

07:40.746 --> 07:42.582
Just like Mai and Ty Lee did.

07:42.874 --> 07:46.335
BOTH: Azula, we are concerned
for you and your well-being.

07:48.045 --> 07:51.507
My father asked you to come
here and talk to me didn't he?

07:51.632 --> 07:54.719
He thinks I can't handle
the responsibility of being Fire Lord.

07:54.844 --> 07:58.347
But I will be the greatest leader
in Fire Nation history.

07:58.473 --> 07:59.849
I'm sure you will.

07:59.974 --> 08:02.226
But considering everything
that's happened today...

08:02.351 --> 08:05.521
...perhaps it's best if
you postpone your coronation.

08:05.897 --> 08:08.316
What? Which one of you just said that?

08:10.443 --> 08:11.652
What a shame.

08:11.777 --> 08:14.071
There's only one way to resolve this.

08:14.197 --> 08:15.865
You two must duel each other.

08:16.032 --> 08:19.160
I order you to fight an Agni Kai.

08:19.243 --> 08:22.038
BOTH: But... We're not Firebenders.

08:22.163 --> 08:24.123
All right, fine.

08:24.248 --> 08:27.084
Lo, you're banished. Li, you can stay.

08:27.210 --> 08:30.254
But, I'm Li. So who is banished?

08:32.715 --> 08:34.800
( VEHICLES RUMBLING )

08:44.101 --> 08:48.231
Ba Sing Se, the Order of
the White Lotus is here.

08:48.314 --> 08:50.149
Here to set you free.

08:50.399 --> 08:52.902
Only once every hundred years,

08:52.985 --> 08:57.114
can a firebender experience
this kind of power.

08:57.198 --> 08:59.992
-( INHALES DEEPLY )
-( COMET ROARING )

09:13.047 --> 09:14.423
( ROARING )

10:13.357 --> 10:15.901
( CRASHING, GEARS GRINDING )

10:27.788 --> 10:29.040
( GRUMBLES )

10:29.707 --> 10:33.044
All right, hair,
it's time to face your doom.

10:36.756 --> 10:41.510
What a shame. You always
had such beautiful hair.

10:41.636 --> 10:43.095
What are you doing here?

10:43.220 --> 10:46.223
I didn't want to miss
my own daughter's coronation.

10:46.349 --> 10:48.434
Don't pretend to act proud.

10:48.559 --> 10:50.102
I know what you really think of me.

10:50.227 --> 10:51.937
You think I'm a monster.

10:52.021 --> 10:53.397
I think you're confused.

10:53.564 --> 10:56.651
All your life you've used
fear to control people.

10:56.817 --> 10:59.362
Like your friends, Mai and Ty Lee.

10:59.862 --> 11:01.238
But what choice do I have?

11:01.364 --> 11:02.823
Trust is for fools.

11:02.948 --> 11:05.326
Fear is the only reliable way.

11:05.451 --> 11:07.578
Even you fear me.

11:07.703 --> 11:10.581
No, I love you, Azula.

11:10.665 --> 11:11.749
I do.

11:15.419 --> 11:17.421
( YELLS )

11:19.215 --> 11:21.926
( SOBBING )

11:31.894 --> 11:35.481
( BREATHING DEEPLY )

11:40.695 --> 11:42.488
We're not gonna catch up to him in time!

11:42.571 --> 11:43.698
No...

11:55.292 --> 11:57.336
( FLAMES ROARING )

12:10.224 --> 12:12.101
( BIRDS SCREECHING )

12:14.937 --> 12:16.772
( CHATTERS )

12:16.897 --> 12:18.941
Momo, time for you to go.

12:19.066 --> 12:21.026
( CHATTERS )

12:21.152 --> 12:23.863
( BREATHING DEEPLY )

12:36.125 --> 12:38.169
( ENGINES SLOWING )

13:19.001 --> 13:20.461
What just happened?

13:20.586 --> 13:21.962
It's Aang!

13:22.087 --> 13:23.339
He's back!

13:38.062 --> 13:41.607
OZAI: After generations of
Fire Lords failed to find you,

13:41.690 --> 13:48.656
now the universe delivers you
to me as an act of providence.

13:49.532 --> 13:52.493
Please listen to me.
We don't have to fight.

13:52.785 --> 13:55.579
You have the power to end it
here and stop what you're doing.

13:55.996 --> 13:59.667
You are right. I do have the power.

13:59.834 --> 14:03.170
I have all the power in the world!

14:03.254 --> 14:05.798
( ROARS )

14:24.108 --> 14:25.234
Go, Aang!

14:25.568 --> 14:26.861
Airbending slice!

14:27.194 --> 14:29.446
Shouldn't we be helping him?

14:29.572 --> 14:30.906
The Fire Lord is Aang's fight.

14:31.574 --> 14:33.158
We need to stay focused
on stopping that fleet

14:33.284 --> 14:34.660
from burning down the Earth Kingdom.

14:34.743 --> 14:36.996
And how do we do that, Captain Boomerang?

14:37.079 --> 14:40.124
I can't see outside of
this floating hunk of metal.

14:41.000 --> 14:42.376
Airship slice!

15:17.453 --> 15:21.582
Whoa, that's a lot of fire, isn't it?

15:43.312 --> 15:45.064
SOKKA: It's gonna be a rough ride.

15:45.189 --> 15:47.274
We need to get
to the top of this thing, fast.

15:47.399 --> 15:49.568
( AIRSHIP RATTLING )

15:49.693 --> 15:50.736
Then what?

15:50.861 --> 15:52.363
Watch each other's backs,

15:52.488 --> 15:54.531
and if we make it that far...
I'll let you know.

15:54.657 --> 15:55.824
( KISSES )

16:00.746 --> 16:03.040
( METAL GROANING, EXPLOSIONS )

16:24.770 --> 16:25.813
SUKI: ( GASPS )

16:25.896 --> 16:27.022
( SCREAMS )

16:27.272 --> 16:28.273
Suki!

16:31.110 --> 16:33.737
SUKI: I'm okay! Just finish the mission!

16:34.029 --> 16:35.197
No...

16:35.280 --> 16:36.490
Sokka, I think we've gotta...

16:36.573 --> 16:37.783
BOTH: Jump!

16:37.866 --> 16:39.243
( EXPLOSION )

16:39.618 --> 16:40.828
BOTH: ( SCREAMING )

16:42.538 --> 16:44.039
( GROANING )

16:49.712 --> 16:52.881
By decree of Phoenix King Ozai,

16:53.048 --> 16:56.260
I now crown you Fire Lord...

16:56.677 --> 16:58.971
What are you waiting for? Do it!

16:59.471 --> 17:02.099
APPA: ( BELLOWS )

17:04.393 --> 17:06.937
Sorry, but you're not gonna
become Fire Lord today.

17:08.981 --> 17:10.441
I am.

17:10.941 --> 17:13.318
( MOCKING LAUGHTER ) You're hilarious.

17:13.861 --> 17:15.779
And you're going down.

17:17.114 --> 17:19.450
Wait. You want to be Fire Lord?

17:19.575 --> 17:21.660
Fine, let's settle this.

17:21.744 --> 17:23.454
Just you and me, brother,

17:23.620 --> 17:25.873
the showdown that was always meant to be.

17:25.956 --> 17:27.124
Agni Kai!

17:28.417 --> 17:30.085
You're on.

17:32.087 --> 17:33.714
What are you doing? She's playing you.

17:33.797 --> 17:35.758
She knows she can't take us both,

17:35.841 --> 17:37.342
so she's trying to separate us.

17:37.468 --> 17:40.054
I know, but I can take her this time.

17:40.262 --> 17:42.056
KATARA: But even you
admitted to your uncle

17:42.181 --> 17:43.974
that would need help facing Azula.

17:44.058 --> 17:45.434
ZUKO: There's something off about her.

17:45.684 --> 17:47.853
I can't explain it, but she's slipping.

17:47.936 --> 17:50.230
And this way, no one else has to get hurt.

18:02.910 --> 18:05.329
I'm sorry it has to end this way, brother.

18:05.954 --> 18:07.206
No, you're not.

18:53.544 --> 18:55.212
( ROARS )

19:05.681 --> 19:07.599
-( THUDS )
-( GROANS )

19:08.183 --> 19:09.685
( GROANING )

19:24.575 --> 19:25.701
( ELECTRICAL ZAPPING )

19:29.955 --> 19:31.039
( LIGHTNING CRACKLING )

19:43.760 --> 19:45.345
( GASPING, GROANING )

19:45.470 --> 19:46.805
( SCREAMS )

19:55.772 --> 19:57.232
-( GROANS )
- Hmm...

20:10.829 --> 20:12.915
( GASPING )

20:58.001 --> 20:59.795
( PANTING )

21:32.035 --> 21:33.036
( GROANS )

21:33.537 --> 21:35.747
( GRUNTING )

21:36.873 --> 21:38.458
( PANTING )

21:38.583 --> 21:39.918
No lightning today?

21:40.043 --> 21:42.296
What's the matter?
Afraid I'll redirect it?

21:42.462 --> 21:45.590
Oh, I'll show you lightning!

21:45.924 --> 21:47.259
( THUNDER CRASHING )

21:47.634 --> 21:49.678
( INHALING DEEPLY )

21:49.803 --> 21:51.763
( ELECTRICAL ZAPPING )

21:58.937 --> 22:01.023
( LIGHTNING CRACKLING )

22:07.571 --> 22:09.406
No!

22:18.165 --> 22:20.042
( THUNDER CRASHING )

22:20.584 --> 22:23.128
-( ELECTRICITY ZAPPING )
-( GROANING )

22:23.420 --> 22:24.671
Zuko!

22:24.796 --> 22:26.173
( LIGHTNING CRACKLES )

22:26.590 --> 22:29.801
( LAUGHING MANIACALLY )

22:39.394 --> 22:40.562
( GRUNTS )

22:42.314 --> 22:44.858
( LAUGHING ) You're weak!

22:44.983 --> 22:46.818
Just like the rest of your people!

22:46.943 --> 22:51.031
They did not deserve to exist
in this world, in my world!

22:51.156 --> 22:53.200
Prepare to join them.

22:53.325 --> 22:55.410
Prepare to die!

23:11.769 --> 23:13.771
( CLOSING THEME PLAYING )
